(F5 T5 U10: group_beam_force_moment_plasti, plastic collapse under a
 prescribed displacement. The propped cantilever of
 group_beam_force_moment_plasti1 (length 4, Mp 1) with the deflection
 under the middle node prescribed (vely -0.1, disy -2 at t 20). Hinges:
 fixed end at deflection 0.7778 (P 1.3333), under the load at
 deflection 1 (P = 6 Mp / L = 1.5, the collapse load). After collapse
 the load stays at 1.5: the moments are Mp at the fixed end and at both
 element ends under the load (the hinge rotation of the middle node is
 shared by the two element ends), the roller reaction is
 P / 2 - Mp / L = 0.5.)
echo -no
number_of_space_dimensions 3
materi_velocity
materi_displacement
beam_rotation
end_initia
node 1 0 0 0
node 2 1 0 0
node 3 2 0 0
node 4 3 0 0
node 5 4 0 0
element 1 -beam 1 2
element 2 -beam 2 3
element 3 -beam 3 4
element 4 -beam 4 5
group_type 0 -beam
group_beam_young 0 1
group_beam_shear 0 1
group_beam_inertia 0 1 1 1
group_beam_memory 0 -total_linear
group_beam_force_moment_plasti 0  1e10 1e10 1e10 1e10 1e10 1  1e10 1e10 1e10 1e10 1e10 1
bounda_dof 0 1 -velx -vely -velz -rotx -roty -rotz
bounda_dof 1 -ra 2 5 -ra -velx -velz -rotx -roty
bounda_dof 2 5 -vely
bounda_dof 3 3 -vely
bounda_time 3 -0.1
control_timestep 10 1. 20.
control_timestep_iterations 10 20
target_item 0 -element_beam_force_moment 1 5
target_value 0 1. 1.e-8
target_item 1 -element_beam_force_moment 2 11
target_value 1 1. 1.e-8
target_item 2 -element_beam_force_moment 3 5
target_value 2 -1. 1.e-8
target_item 3 -node_rhside 3 -vely
target_value 3 1.5 1.e-8
target_item 4 -node_rhside 5 -vely
target_value 4 -0.5 1.e-8
end_data
